Value Required LOCAL_INTERFACE (\S+)
Value CHASSIS_ID (\S+)
Value Required NEIGHBOR_INTERFACE (\S+)
Value NEIGHBOR_NAME (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*Local Interface\s*:\s*${LOCAL_INTERFACE}\s*$$ -> Neighbor

Neighbor
  ^\s*Management (?:address|Info)\b.*$$ -> Management
  ^\s*Local Interface\s*:\s*(\S+)\s*$$ -> Continue.Record
  ^\s*Local Interface\s*:\s*${LOCAL_INTERFACE}\s*$$
  ^\s*Chassis (?:ID|Id)\s*:\s*${CHASSIS_ID}\s*$$
  ^\s*Port ID\s*:\s*${NEIGHBOR_INTERFACE}\s*$$
  ^\s*System name\s*:\s*${NEIGHBOR_NAME}\s*$$

Management
  ^\s*Local Interface\s*:\s*(\S+)\s*$$ -> Continue.Record
  ^\s*Local Interface\s*:\s*${LOCAL_INTERFACE}\s*$$ -> Neighbor
